PRoot native libraries (libproot_exec.so, libproot_loader.so)
============================================================
These binaries are builds of PRoot (https://proot-me.github.io / https://github.com/proot-me/proot),
licensed under GNU GPL v2 or later.

Cuplivo vendors them solely as the Android userland chroot helper for the optional
Linux sandbox feature. Corresponding source for PRoot is available from the
upstream project. No AGPL application source from third-party apps is included.

